     "title": "狀態變化的焓變（焓階圖）",
     "body": "焓階圖（焓 / kJmol⁻¹）：\n- CH4(g) + 2O2(g) → CO2(g) + 2H2O(g)　ΔH = −802 kJmol⁻¹\n- CO2(g) + 2H2O(g) → CO2(g) + 2H2O(l)　**ΔH = −(890 − 802) kJmol⁻¹**\n- 對應過程：**2H2O(g) → 2H2O(l)**",
     "page": 4,
     "tags": [
