     "title": "②(i) ΔH 隨方程式倍大係數而改變",
     "body": "- 3CH4(g) + 6O2(g) → 3CO2(g) + 6H2O(l)　ΔH = 3(−890) kJmol⁻¹ = **−2670 kJmol⁻¹**\n- 1/3 CH4(g) + 2/3 O2(g) → 1/3 CO2(g) + 2/3 H2O(l)　ΔH = 1/3 (−890) kJmol⁻¹ = **−297 kJmol⁻¹**",
     "page": 5,
     "tags": [
