     "title": "生成焓例：NO2",
     "body": "e.g. 1/2 N2(g) + O2(g) → NO2(g)　**ΔHf^⦵[NO2(g)] = +39.9 kJmol⁻¹**\n焓階圖（焓 / kJmol⁻¹）：由 1/2 N2(g) + O2(g) 升至 NO2(g)，ΔHf^⦵[NO2(g)] = +39.9 kJmol⁻¹",
