     "title": "燃燒焓例：H2 與 C(石墨)",
     "body": "e.g. 1　H2(g) + 1/2 O2(g) → H2O(l)　**ΔHc^⦵[H2(g)] = −286 kJmol⁻¹**\n\ne.g. 2　C(石墨) + 1/2 O2(g) → CO(g)　**ΔHc[C(石墨)] = −111 kJmol⁻¹**\nC(石墨) + O2(g) → CO2(g)　**ΔHc^⦵[C(石墨)] = −394 kJmol⁻¹**\n- * 亦可視為：ΔHf^⦵[CO2(g)]、ΔHf^⦵[CO(g)]",
